        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi, I&#39;m new to Sentinels (three games and loving it).&nbsp; I have a rules question involving the interaction between Interpolation Beam (IB) and Impromptu Invention (I2).&nbsp; IB deals damage every time a player &quot;draws&quot; a hero card.&nbsp; I2 first says &quot;draw a card&quot; (IB clearly causes damage here).&nbsp; Then it says, &quot;Search your deck for an equipment card and either put it into play or your hand.&quot;&nbsp; So does this &quot;search&quot; trigger IB again?&nbsp; In other words, is a successful &quot;Search&quot; considered a &quot;Draw&quot;?</p><p>Thanks for your help.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
